 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** Evaluating the kernel is $O(1)$ per sample. Computing the 2D footprint requires a closed-form integral, which is also $O(1)$ but involves more complex arithmetic than simple polynomial evaluation [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Memory Complexity:** $O(1)$ as it is a parametric function.
